CELL_PARAMETERS angstrom
  15.0 0 0
  0 15.0 0
  0 0 15.0
ATOMIC_POSITIONS angstrom
  I  6.1550860211  7.5000000000  7.5000000000
  I  8.8449139789  7.4900000000  7.5000000000
K_POINTS gamma
